     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜をもとに: taking as a basis",
     "texto": [
      "It shows the material or data that serves as a starting point: noun + **をもとに**. **この データ を もとに、けいかく を たてます** (based on this data, I will draw up a plan)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜にもとづいて: based on; in accordance with",
     "texto": [
      "It presents the basis or criterion that supports an action: noun + **にもとづいて**. **きそく に もとづいて、判断します** (we will decide in accordance with the rules). The difference with **をもとに** depends on the context; it is not an absolute opposition."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
